<title>FRANCE: F. Telecom sees stabilisation of results.</title>
<headline>F. Telecom sees stabilisation of results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom head Michel Bon said on Wednesday he expected profits excluding exceptional items to stabilise in 1997 at 1996 levels.</p>
<p>&quot;All of the measures taken should allow us to stabilise results at the record level seen in 1996 excluding exceptional items,&quot; he told a news conference called to present the 1996 results.</p>
</text>
